+- [Codex App Server](https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/app-server)
+- [Codex background hooks](https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/hooks#how-background-hooks-run)
+- `codex-rs/ext/monitor/`: transport, journal, native worker, and model tools.
+- `codex-rs/app-server/src/native_monitor.rs`: exact frontend binding and native ingress.
+- `codex-rs/app-server/src/message_processor.rs`: disconnect and unsubscribe teardown.
+
+This branch implements the Codex adapter. Other providers can share the same MP
+subscription and receipt contract, but each harness needs its own session-owned
+ingress adapter. They are not implemented by this Rust extension.
